    "chunk_text": "\u00f0\u00e6t we comon to eow to eowre manr\u00e6dene. & we mid us namon nigbacene hlafas, \u00f0e for \u00f0am langan wege nu synd gefynegode, swa swa ge Vre reaf synd forwerede, sy\u00f0\u00f0an we gewendon hider, & ure gescy geclutode, swa swa ge geseon Hi undorfeng \u00f0a Iosue, & ne befran his Drihten. & hi ealle him sworon \u00f0\u00e6t hi man slean nolde. Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a ymbe \u00f0ry dagas wear\u00f0 heora d\u00e6d cu\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6t hi on neawyste eardodon, & eall heora Hi ne mihton swa \u00f0eah \u00f0a men acwellan for heora a\u00f0sware, ac arodon heora life. & Iosue him bebead \u00f0\u00e6t hi b\u00e6ron w\u00e6ter to \u00f0\u00e6s folces neode & to Godes weofode & wudedon him HW\u00c6T \u00f0a Adonisedech, cyningc on Ierusalem, sende to \u00f0am cyningum on Ebron & on Hierimoth & \u00d0a comon \u00f0a fif cyningas mid fyrde to Gabaon & wicodon \u00f0\u00e6r onemn, woldon hi oferwinnan. \u00d0a sende seo buruhwaru sona to Iosue biddende \u00f0\u00e6t he come & \u00f0a burh geheolde. Iosue \u00f0a ferde mid his fyrde \u00f0yderweard. & Drihten him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to: Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00f0u \u00f0e nan \u00f0ingc; on \u00f0ine handa ic hi bet\u00e6ce; ne m\u00e6g heora nan Iosue him \u00f0a feng on mid gefeohte, & Drihten hi aflymde fram Israhela bearnum; hi feollon \u00f0a swy\u00f0e & God him sende ufan greate hagolstanas, & wurdon ma manna ofslagene mid \u00f0",
